As the captain and his men hurry toward the Menagerie and you are led in the other direction, you pass the gaunt figure of Iarmid Duskwatcher, who your captors don't seem to notice. He gives you a pitying look. "Did this one not warn you to change your path? Had you listened, you would have avoided these persons of dark intent."

Just then the Oasis begins to blur around you. The last thing you see, before you are ripped from the mere and returned to your own body is the Duskwatcher, turning his gaze back to the Menagerie to witness the unfolding of tragic events.

